      "versionNonce": 180324597,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767031727412,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因为它是一个离散的输入模型",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因为它是一个离散的输入模型",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LfXs4SHDLflXB0RIKUMjK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 396.31312356217865,
      "y": -3020.9748463648916,
      "width": 917.447811596589,
      "height": 73.9877267416604,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 154540569,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 70034005,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767031727412,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "那也就是说每次的输入需要记下来\n这就是所谓的记忆，这样我就知道了前面已经有几次这样的情况出现了",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "那也就是说每次的输入需要记下来\n这就是所谓的记忆，这样我就知道了前面已经有几次这样的情况出现了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bP6PNch_Yu3MsBSrlqqVB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 391.2396407354431,
      "y": -2918.8367662511655,
      "width": 651.0919953266115,
      "height": 36.9938633708302,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2138926841,
      "version": 383,
      "versionNonce": 2003799989,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767031727412,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当我记忆满足一定的情况，我就要改变我的输出了",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当我记忆满足一定的情况，我就要改变我的输出了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mv37U_xvB-M6jxTcx8LFt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 395.0447109225792,
      "y": -2867.093541384619,
      "width": 295.9509069666416,
      "height": 36.9938633708302,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1606887385,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 289328283,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767031729150,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "就好像人类的记忆一样",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "就好像人类的记忆一样",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q2Nzf9cA38-_xZWJZ6B-c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 392.50792435068615,
      "y": -2816.9303466180604,
      "width": 2485.9876185197895,
      "height": 110.9815901124906,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 69649593,
      "version": 497,
      "versionNonce": 167009657,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766890939323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "就好像人类是从输入然后通过很多的输入来形成了一个记忆，然后根据这个记忆来做出行为，那这个行为可能是根据当前记忆做出的也有可能是根据当前记忆再加上更新的输入来做出这个行为\n所以如果人输入是一个错误的输入是一个有问题的输入那他的记忆就是有问题他随之而来做出的行为也是有问题的\n就好像他接受了一些虚假的知识让他形成了一定的记忆这个记忆会产生输出输出又是个错误的输出",
      "fontSize": 29.59509069666416,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "就好像人类是从输入然后通过很多的输入来形成了一个记忆，然后根据这个记忆来做出行为，那这个行为可能是根据当前记忆做出的也有可能是根据当前记忆再加上更新的输入来做出这个行为\n所以如果人输入是一个错误的输入是一个有问题的输入那他的记忆就是有问题他随之而来做出的行为也是有问题的\n就好像他接受了一些虚假的知识让他形成了一定的记忆这个记忆会产生输出输出又是个错误的输出",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
